tags: [cross-pollination, local-synthesis, garden]
date: {__import__("datetime").date.today()}
source_a: {note_a}
source_b: {note_b}
---
# {title}

{idea}

*Cross-pollinated locally by SOWL from: {note_a} + {note_b}*
""")

